        children: "function VALUE-ITERATION(P, R, gamma, theta) returns V, pi\n    V(s) <- 0 for all s\n    repeat\n        Delta <- 0\n        for each s in S:\n            v <- V(s)\n            V(s) <- max_a [R(s,a) + gamma sum_{s'} P(s'|s,a) V(s')]\n            Delta <- max(Delta, |v - V(s)|)\n    until Delta < theta\n    for each s in S:\n        pi(s) <- argmax_a [R(s,a) + gamma sum_{s'} P(s'|s,a) V(s')]\n    return V, pi\n"
